<v>~</v><b>4.</b> Hi(h) ti(g)bi(h) pas(h!iwj)sú(ji)ro(hg) (,) sol(gh)vé(j)bant(jk) mú(ji)ni(h)a(g) lau(h)dis :(h) (:) Nos(h) ti(h)bi(g) re(h!iwj)gnán(ji)ti(hg) (,) pán(gh)gi(j)mus(jk) ec(ji)ce(h) me(gh)los.(h) (::)()Glória, laus.()